                "text": "I sat down with @calleymeans to discuss how the government, particularly the IRS, looks at exercise and diet versus weight loss drugs and other pharmaceuticals. \n\nListen now: https://t.co/KoHgq94VCQ https://t.co/AFstjXpJsg",
